 .../devicetree/bindings/net/thead,th1520-gmac.yaml |  3 +
 .../bindings/net/toshiba,visconti-dwmac.yaml       |  3 +
 MAINTAINERS                                        |  1 +
 24 files changed, 165 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

